  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、暗い顔をしてどうしたんだ？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ。……この間の仕事で、\r\nまたミスをしてしまったんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あんなにレッスンを重ねてきたのに\r\n仕事ひとつ完璧にこなせないなんて……アイドル失格です",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この頃、以前にも増してレッスン量が\r\n増えたのは、それが原因か……）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、そんなに落ちこむな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "焦ることはない。仕事の後の反省会だって欠かさずに\r\nしているし、経験を重ねていけばいずれ……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "適当な励ましはやめてください\r\n何のためにもなりません",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "自分が１番わかっています。こんなレベルじゃ\r\nトップアイドルなんてとても目指せないことを",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……もしかしたら、アイドルなんて\r\n最初から私には向いていなかったのかもしれませんね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織……そんなことは絶対にない\r\nこれを見てくれ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0099",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……え？\r\nプロデューサー、このファイルの束は……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだまとめている途中なんだけどな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "！　これは練習メニュー……！\r\nプロデューサーが考えてくれたんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。こっちのファイルには、灯織のイメージに\r\n合いそうなオーディション情報をまとめてある",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いつの間にこんなことを……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030090"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "select": "そりゃ、\r\n超能力でパパッと……",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "はは、\r\nちょっと疲れた……",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "灯織の気持ちに\r\n応えたかったんだ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030100,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "真面目に答えてください",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "す、すまない……\r\n本当は、空いた時間を使ってこしらえたんだ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "１日も早く、灯織をトップアイドルに\r\nしてやりたいからな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "トップアイドル……\r\nまだ、仕事一つろくにこなせない私がトップだなんて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいや、俺は灯織の才能ならトップアイドルだって\r\n夢じゃないと信じている",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "才能……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。灯織は自分の厳しい性格や言い方に\r\n悩んでいるようだけどな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、それだけ物事に真剣に向き合っている証拠で、\r\n灯織の才能なんだと俺は思う",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……才能だなんて、そんな風に考えたこと\r\nありませんでした",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そんな考え方もあるんですね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……ありがとうございます、プロデューサー\r\n少し気持ちが楽になったみたいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私、いつかトップアイドルになれるよう精進します",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、楽しみにしている",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……さっそく、レッスンについて相談したいのですが\r\nいいですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ。……そのための俺だからな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "笑いごとではありません。質問に答えてください",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺も灯織に負けてられないなって思ってな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織がこんなに頑張っているのに\r\n俺だけぼんやりしていられないだろう？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、灯織を見習って\r\n俺ができる全力でサポートしようと思ったんだ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "見習うだなんて……私にそんな長所はありません",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことはないぞ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺がこうやって資料を集めたのは、灯織の\r\nひた向きな姿勢に応えたいと思ったからなんだ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私の……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、だから自信を持て。灯織に心を打たれた人間が\r\n少なくとも、ここにいるんだからな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうだ？　さっそく練習メニューを試してみないか？\r\n悩むより慣れろ、心身を動かせ、だ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……わかりました。よろしくお願いします\r\nプロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030240,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私の気持ち……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、灯織のアイドルへの切実な想いは\r\n痛いくらい伝わってきたからな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "プロデューサーとして、やれるべきサポートは\r\nすべてやっておきたかったんだ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "練習メニューはどうかな？\r\n俺なりに考えてみたつもりなんだが……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "一通りのローテーションから、休憩のタイミングまで……\r\nすごい！　私の理想のメニューです、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よかった。そう言ってもらえると嬉しいよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……こんなに、私に向き合ってくれた人は\r\nプロデューサーが初めてです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私は、ついキツイことを言ってしまうことがあって\r\nそのせいで人と接するのも苦手で……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だから、アイドルになりたいって思ったんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私の目指すアイドルは、なりたかった理想の\r\n自分でもあったから……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030310,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だけど最近はちょっと焦っていたかもしれません",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030310"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサー、改めてお願いします\r\n私をプロデュースしてください",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001030330,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私の夢にはプロデューサーが必要なんです\r\nだから、お願いします",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200103/1002001030330"
  },
